    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> Baron’s Secluded Library</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> relics class feature</p>\n<p><strong>Benefits:</strong> You gain 2 additional relics which may correspond to any of the six spirit legends. These relics may have different taboo selections and spirit power selections from your normal relics.</p>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> You may select this feat multiple times, each time gaining 2 additional relics.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/champion-medium#toc30\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
